{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>中國歌手薛之謙日前在成都舉辦巡迴演唱會，頂著右臉紅腫、貼著膠布的造型登台。向來不按牌理出牌的他，不但沒有刻意遮掩，反而大方在台上秀出自己臉部紅腫的「高清無碼照」，把自己這輩子長過最大的痘痘直接投上大螢幕，還笑問全場觀眾「恐怖嗎？」</p><p>據陸媒報導，薛之謙近期巡演行程緊湊，在成都連開多場，中間僅休息了三天。演出當天，他一上台就主動向歌迷分享這個「小笑話」，坦承自己長出了「這一輩子發的最大的一顆痘」，還幽默誇飾形容：</p><blockquote><p>我把整個小區的痘，全發在這上面了！</p></blockquote><figure><img alt=\"薛之謙日前在成都舉辦巡迴演唱會，頂著右臉紅腫、貼著膠布的造型登台。（微博@薛之謙的小話筒）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189263691749527552543218.jpeg/QAAV0bbZ5MXmcEenC2cCNCCkWpWNgFiCT9DaMk_Q2jI\"/><figcaption>薛之謙日前在成都舉辦巡迴演唱會，頂著右臉紅腫、貼著膠布的造型登台。（微博@薛之謙的小話筒）</figcaption></figure><p>更多薛之謙的相片：</p><figure><img alt=\"薛之謙（weibo@薛之謙）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260728/1158742024531218432917246.jpeg/eB0MoIHPOQn0emwGRPUL7PYm5cvH49a0lBJBZpQSQWY\"/><figcaption>薛之謙（weibo@薛之謙）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260330/1115238342389141504862417.jpeg/EvphMPPGHXc4itjVbWg1oFoDwv3sDxXEys07NMrNOzQ\"/><figcaption>薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260330/1115237008143814656372480.jpeg/CTaNkGfZ_PSv8x6JmdSbCf3I5uILfVdVKsb54yrG-eM\"/><figcaption>薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260330/1115237008768634880179036.jpeg/LqYchrmQakPhUtQVCwY430pFxb5EclG8TGvm9Exr5vQ\"/><figcaption>薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260330/1115237009129345024901764.jpeg/w8c-gWISpgKS2Ha7MbRrl4KvVgZmS6l72bnwW9m58Fs\"/><figcaption>薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260330/1115237009032876032528479.jpeg/lIe3MQv3qnmDn0j20DjIAyqBBdCtPJzZTQl7N00Jezc\"/><figcaption>薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260330/1115237010916249600270418.jpeg/jEQ7AHkiXwQpBLNIg8b1sIm39ND3SSnHN0zmhzdM5oc\"/><figcaption>薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260330/1115237011260182528254198.jpeg/be_8HB-8g5ziYZxtHoCCQVyRCrK7SJQmYRJfwmESX8I\"/><figcaption>薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260330/1115237011348262912095482.jpeg/G170fjeT82VjwNNmNngKkubUxbaVH9n0bly0z25ctM8\"/><figcaption>薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260330/1115237004225941504236874.jpeg/ctADncjp9JijGUFrsNtyPD3F3s_M7unb_OIM4_ziDOM\"/><figcaption>薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260330/1115237004255301632465173.jpeg/dbpVYPLMw2wjaN30jI3Xgzvcsb33QzIxqCyxJ6gssSc\"/><figcaption>薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260330/1115237004515348480280563.jpeg/mx0PQAALnTl2M8sstG0C0BQCNvyK4wTVZQmUXGUJlFw\"/><figcaption>薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260330/1115237005069258752136250.jpeg/47Yqo_ZNc7nAZnOP118DoLJlWbfkXiyCnbSMpJ20jKQ\"/><figcaption>薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260330/1115237006457442304965784.jpeg/IjBb22koKkF15MUd7BiEousHjN8p2CElfwGe6H8Bnug\"/><figcaption>薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260330/1115237006855901184829356.jpeg/ptg6bu6yHjv4RQ0_uKgboEYqqU0BSMLV-m9Tu_pvU7s\"/><figcaption>薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260330/1115237006809763840308216.jpeg/B5ES5i1-xCUCWwGowZkf92VR3K0wX3H7h4uh0oeLodI\"/><figcaption>薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260330/1115237000597868544054261.jpeg/R7Bu3Or57RX73Cimx3wMm4_INtnggkl5vSGJcr0hiXI\"/><figcaption>薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260330/1115237001910554624429751.jpeg/dVm8yx8Vg2lHZjn2f-GtUV3Zp3DeD0W4hzrO8oc6zvI\"/><figcaption>薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260330/1115237002699345920603752.jpeg/PTT8u3JFAN3FyTNWwyFT2c37PQ1dqI-EoBLTbKAS02w\"/><figcaption>薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260330/1115237001818279936291806.jpeg/zi3rjfyds5gLKeQ21zIVfDR7oLv1KV-07Tohle06IZU\"/><figcaption>薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260330/1115236998383144960710528.jpeg/uL7Q7mfDMIOKpsiwdNEwWAQ--R3tub4RrxyI368ciN8\"/><figcaption>薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260330/1115236491497312256802569.jpeg/277bx6gza5WpQN0oOmL55swqRusEypiOCoTDBwqEwwc\"/><figcaption>薛之謙（微博@薛之謙）</figcaption></figure><p>讓人哭笑不得的是，薛之謙完全沒有在顧偶像包袱。他在演出空檔直接把毫無濾鏡、超近距離的紅腫特寫照放送在大螢幕上，畫面中可見右臉頰嚴重發炎。他更透露除了這顆巨痘，嘴角還長了水泡；超震撼的畫面連他自己看了都受不了，急忙喊導播：「好了快收掉，好噁心啊！」接著調皮地反問台下粉絲：「噁心嗎？」逗趣又真實的反應讓現場笑聲不斷，他在台上「自我放棄」搞笑亂舞的畫面，也迅速衝上微博熱搜。</p><p>儘管臉腫到張嘴都有痛感，據悉還伴隨扁桃腺發炎，薛之謙仍貼著膠布敬業完成長達3小時的演出，且全程全開麥，演唱表現獲得不少歌迷好評。而他臉上的膠布意外成為全場焦點，粉絲甚至打趣封他為「膠布狐狸大王」。</p><figure><img alt=\"薛之謙近日在成都舉辦巡迴演唱會，右臉紅腫、貼著膠布，演唱會上還忍不住曝光自己長痘痘模樣。（微博圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189264069496934400165042.png/go123V5bQUdQc3GbPt7lmD8kr0JAsRNMWOf3FVjn9xU\"/><figcaption>薛之謙近日在成都舉辦巡迴演唱會，右臉紅腫、貼著膠布，演唱會上還忍不住曝光自己長痘痘模樣。（微博圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>事後有粉絲與醫學科普指出，那顆「巨痘」其實是「火癤子」（學名為癤或俗稱疔子、粒仔，由細菌感染毛囊引起的急性化膿性炎症），疑似是因為吃了太多成都美食導致嚴重上火。歌迷見狀紛紛留言心疼，叮嚀他好好休息、千萬別自己亂擠，並暫時戒掉辛辣食物；不過也有人笑虧「看來這火鍋沒白吃」，希望他早日康復。</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀：「短劇女神」王格格爆拍戲致單耳失聰　掌摑戲遭大力真打耳膜穿孔】「短劇女神」王格格（微博＠王格格啊啊）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260913/1175784559510294528076195.jpeg/hbSr-06krQSaCf67lLnoE0nbF80LZRLrgXsxfYF7MX0\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：「短劇女神」王格格爆拍戲致單耳失聰　掌摑戲遭大力真打耳膜穿孔】「短劇女神」王格格（微博＠王格格啊啊）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「短劇女神」王格格（微博＠王格格啊啊）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260913/1175784567945564160729846.jpeg/THS_I2ugJdyb5oZPBx95PjyM7-gXsa5LsMpMX7DKTF8\"/><figcaption>「短劇女神」王格格（微博＠王格格啊啊）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「短劇女神」王格格（微博＠王格格啊啊）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260913/1175784568612458496578192.jpeg/EiFisiiZ5U2uCdrgWbOmsKjEsDBut3jVlWoN6ZVqDek\"/><figcaption>「短劇女神」王格格（微博＠王格格啊啊）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「短劇女神」王格格（微博＠王格格啊啊）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260913/1175784566439677952217093.jpeg/ZLyFe0bsAdf7uc3YC1ctb2cAAYghxs9KZsIbD2bCGw8\"/><figcaption>「短劇女神」王格格（微博＠王格格啊啊）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「短劇女神」王格格（微博＠王格格啊啊）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260913/1175784558835011584741829.jpeg/szsa3P1RuIjAs1CWJqtrjDEIPT5DsLl-YyGtt2Mhrbc\"/><figcaption>「短劇女神」王格格（微博＠王格格啊啊）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「短劇女神」王格格（微博＠王格格啊啊）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260913/1175784563755192320784095.jpeg/5klxSHe-VFSdOBi2iU8Q2Gq-uqrmtqp9we_-H8Hv_h8\"/><figcaption>「短劇女神」王格格（微博＠王格格啊啊）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「短劇女神」王格格（微博＠王格格啊啊）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260913/1175784565793755136273584.jpeg/iDqmru9OOYIodkueHGZeTrE1xnqa3IJ_VRw6QFUcOkA\"/><figcaption>「短劇女神」王格格（微博＠王格格啊啊）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「短劇女神」王格格（微博＠王格格啊啊）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260913/1175784560080719872723659.jpeg/I5xXDyUzoL7xxOdxynTHSfIc2mb4mRDVXjIhGV4yIRk\"/><figcaption>「短劇女神」王格格（微博＠王格格啊啊）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「短劇女神」王格格（微博＠王格格啊啊）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260913/1175784561855041536398654.jpeg/Uhpc1UEdXRO8ZN_Ks0O51vFMAL2GGWNiSoAG_0qABv8\"/><figcaption>「短劇女神」王格格（微博＠王格格啊啊）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「短劇女神」王格格（微博＠王格格啊啊）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260913/1175784564514361344120483.jpeg/rExigL3JNO1HR2tyzvUiZ92C1NByp3rppVyhb6VcoW8\"/><figcaption>「短劇女神」王格格（微博＠王格格啊啊）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"「短劇女神」王格格（微博＠王格格啊啊）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260913/1175784562287054848567983.jpeg/2YwkwKk5UTvq9PG0bIm59HtRZLqboueSUW6kglFupII\"/><figcaption>「短劇女神」王格格（微博＠王格格啊啊）</figcaption></figure><p>獨／陳隨意爆病情惡化！緊急停工動刀 忍痛揭1億收入真相</p><p>「賭王最美媳婦」維密壓軸美翻！昔摔倒遭群嘲　產後胖15公斤自律逆襲</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T16:21:20.369913+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1364,"images":35,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T16:00:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T19:37:46.481449+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T16:17:48.535878+00:00","content_hash":"689bff6f326841c544ec02bad1ddf901965c8e602797f5774228bed01b96134f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}